WEBVTT

00:02.510 --> 00:05.730
Um, we made a new friend...

00:06.220 --> 00:08.840
Emelenzia, from Germany!

00:09.330 --> 00:11.930
She’s even shorter than I am.

00:12.600 --> 00:16.400
We had a bit of a rough start, but I guess she’s a good girl.

00:16.400 --> 00:18.930
I hope we can all get along.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

02:16.240 --> 02:18.530
Good!

02:19.240 --> 02:21.870
I’m off, Brother.

02:23.570 --> 02:28.240
Operation Cesedu Mamoru Yoshimura!

02:42.690 --> 02:44.850
<i>I’m spending Christmas this year with Ayako-san.</i>

02:45.290 --> 02:48.240
Ayako-san, it’s almost Christmas!

02:49.120 --> 02:51.230
Y-Yeah, you’re right.

02:51.230 --> 02:52.530
I hadn’t realized it at all.

02:52.530 --> 02:59.040
Who did I see reading stacks of
tree catalogs and cake recipes?

03:03.880 --> 03:04.710
Ayako-san...

03:06.980 --> 03:11.020
Anyway, um... This will be our first Christmas together.

03:11.020 --> 03:16.720
Just being with you is the best Christmas present ever!

03:17.410 --> 03:19.190
Yes. For me, too!

03:21.030 --> 03:24.930
If you get good grades on the semester finals,

03:24.930 --> 03:27.600
that would be the best present ever for me.

03:27.600 --> 03:28.640
Right!

03:29.120 --> 03:32.100
Is there anything you want as a present?

03:32.100 --> 03:36.970
Well, you just gave me that sweater.

03:36.970 --> 03:40.080
I was really happy to get that little glass bottle.

03:40.770 --> 03:44.440
<i>For midterms, she tutored me,</i>

03:44.440 --> 03:46.950
<i>but my grades were awful...</i>

03:47.830 --> 03:49.910
<i>For her sake...</i>

03:57.090 --> 03:59.520
<i>I have to do my best this time!</i>

04:02.430 --> 04:04.310
All together!

04:03.740 --> 04:07.510
Em-chan Fan Club

04:04.310 --> 04:07.510
Em-chan!

04:07.510 --> 04:09.780
Watanabe’s up to something again.

04:09.780 --> 04:13.520
I’m amazed he doesn’t tire of doing
that stuff every morning.

04:19.610 --> 04:22.150
Who cares about that foreigner?

04:22.150 --> 04:25.200
Ayako-san, you’re my only love.

04:25.200 --> 04:29.500
Yet, you constantly move further away...

04:30.950 --> 04:32.430
Wait!

04:32.430 --> 04:33.960
We apologize for the interruption, but...

04:33.960 --> 04:37.170
Abiko’s
Fantasy Theater
Part 1

04:40.310 --> 04:42.820
Ayako-san, you’re wrong!

04:42.820 --> 04:45.280
You shouldn’t mistake pity for love!

04:45.280 --> 04:51.350
I, Abiko Tsuneo, am the only one who can teach you

04:51.350 --> 04:53.090
the wonders of true love.

04:53.090 --> 04:54.360
That’s right!

04:54.360 --> 04:55.920
I was wrong!

04:55.920 --> 04:59.300
I never should have bothered
with this little kid!

04:59.300 --> 05:00.900
Abiko-kun!

05:01.400 --> 05:05.820
Ayako-san!

05:06.490 --> 05:11.240
10 Yen

05:07.390 --> 05:08.760
Hot.

05:11.240 --> 05:13.610
Em-chan Fan Club

05:17.640 --> 05:18.980
Em-chan...

05:28.010 --> 05:29.320
Mamoru!

05:29.320 --> 05:30.560
Emelenzia!

05:30.560 --> 05:32.790
Good morning, Mamoru!

05:32.790 --> 05:34.900
Good morning. Have you gotten use—

05:34.900 --> 05:35.890
Yoshimura!

05:35.890 --> 05:38.910
It isn’t fair that you’re Em-chan’s only friend!

05:38.910 --> 05:40.980
Not fair? I don’t know...

05:40.980 --> 05:42.490
Good morning, Em-chan.

05:42.490 --> 05:43.840
You look cute today!

05:44.420 --> 05:45.580
Thanks, thanks.

05:51.120 --> 05:53.580
So what are you doing here?

05:53.580 --> 05:58.620
She said she’d like to participate
in Student Council activities.

05:58.620 --> 06:00.060
What are you doing?

06:00.060 --> 06:02.190
You aren’t up to something again, are you?

06:02.190 --> 06:04.320
No, not at all...

06:04.320 --> 06:07.380
I just thought it would help me acclimate to life here.

06:07.380 --> 06:10.970
Anyway, I look forward to working with you,

06:10.970 --> 06:11.850
Mamoru!

06:11.850 --> 06:13.500
Yes. Me, too.

06:13.500 --> 06:14.820
Let’s both do our best!

06:15.870 --> 06:18.500
Now that the new member has been introduced,

06:15.870 --> 06:19.810
And so...

06:18.500 --> 06:19.810
our day’s topic is...

06:23.240 --> 06:26.230
It’s just a photo of Mamoru leaving home.

06:26.230 --> 06:28.040
We were watching it the entire time.

06:28.040 --> 06:29.450
Good job!

06:29.450 --> 06:31.910
We even got meat buns as presents!

06:29.450 --> 06:31.910
Venus
Meat Buns

06:33.390 --> 06:35.330
Mother?

06:35.330 --> 06:36.880
Then, let us...

06:38.830 --> 06:40.160
Nice shot!

06:44.500 --> 06:47.830
Is this what the Student Council does?

06:47.830 --> 06:48.880
Well...

06:50.500 --> 06:52.770
I’ll see you at lunch, Ayako-san.

06:52.770 --> 06:54.180
Right!

07:05.980 --> 07:07.960
Semester finals?

07:07.960 --> 07:09.460
Yeah.

07:09.460 --> 07:11.480
I don’t think I’m gonna do that well...

07:15.110 --> 07:16.060
<i>Good!</i>

07:22.960 --> 07:24.980
Oh, that’s rare.

07:24.980 --> 07:27.310
You’re not with Mamoru-san?

07:27.310 --> 07:29.780
He said he had to meet a friend.

07:29.780 --> 07:32.550
So that’s why you’re jealous.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.170
Is it a problem?

07:36.170 --> 07:38.270
Not at all.

07:39.290 --> 07:42.060
Well, sometimes a man’s gotta do his own stuff.

07:42.060 --> 07:45.730
Make too much of a fuss,
and he won’t like you anymore.

07:47.090 --> 07:49.430
The second time today!

07:49.430 --> 07:51.800
Brother!

07:51.800 --> 07:53.630
Thank you, Emelenzia.

07:53.630 --> 07:56.700
No, teaching you Beatrice Control is nothing.

07:56.700 --> 07:58.600
You’ll probably help me out with lots of stuff, too.

07:58.600 --> 08:01.210
So this is just me paying you back.

08:01.210 --> 08:04.130
I spend my afternoons with Ayako-san,

08:04.130 --> 08:06.310
so I can have you watch me practice at lunch.

08:06.310 --> 08:09.850
Oh, don’t tell Ayako-san.

08:09.850 --> 08:12.800
I want to secretly improve, to surprise her.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.790
Of course!

08:14.790 --> 08:16.820
That’s better for me, too!

08:18.320 --> 08:20.290
Never mind...

08:22.690 --> 08:25.640
First, let’s see your power’s strength.

08:25.640 --> 08:28.070
Can you try to move this rock?

08:28.070 --> 08:29.610
OK.

08:39.350 --> 08:44.670
<i>I can’t believe it. How strange...
He can’t even do this?</i>

08:46.400 --> 08:51.330
<i>Then that wasn’t Mamoru’s power.
It was the Witch Beatrice’s...</i>

08:53.990 --> 08:57.730
<i>Anyway, there’s something I have to do.</i>

08:57.730 --> 09:00.450
Concentrate your will.

09:01.140 --> 09:03.900
Let your body go limp.

09:06.560 --> 09:10.550
If you’re tense, you won’t attain true concentration.

09:10.550 --> 09:13.080
You need to relax.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.440
Relax?

09:14.440 --> 09:15.230
Yes, that.

09:15.230 --> 09:16.680
OK, I’ll try.

09:17.870 --> 09:20.860
That’s right... Go limp.

09:20.860 --> 09:22.480
That’s it, that’s it.

09:28.130 --> 09:29.630
H-Hey...

09:38.300 --> 09:40.620
E-Emelenzia...

09:41.970 --> 09:44.260
That’s enough for today!

09:44.260 --> 09:45.680
See you tomorrow!

09:47.810 --> 09:50.730
What was that?

09:58.950 --> 10:00.100
What’s wrong?

10:00.100 --> 10:02.720
N-Nothing, nothing...

10:04.930 --> 10:07.070
<i>Why did she body slam me?</i>

10:07.070 --> 10:09.350
<i>Was that some German practice technique?</i>

10:11.630 --> 10:14.090
Boss, welcome back.

10:14.090 --> 10:15.970
How was school?

10:15.970 --> 10:18.190
Check out this roller!

10:18.190 --> 10:19.430
It’s great!

10:19.430 --> 10:21.300
It gets everything out of the carpet fast!

10:27.810 --> 10:29.880
Are you OK, boss?

10:29.880 --> 10:32.270
Want me to give you a massage with this roller?

10:34.690 --> 10:36.660
Doctor Koba

10:35.190 --> 10:38.570
Why am I always so shy?

10:36.660 --> 10:38.570
666 Ways to Seduce a Boy

10:39.870 --> 10:41.280
Brother...

10:41.280 --> 10:43.490
I’m still no good.

10:43.490 --> 10:48.010
Seduce Mamoru Yoshimura
and take him
from Witch Beatrice
(Translation)

10:48.010 --> 10:52.300
That may be more difficult than
any other task I’ve had.

10:52.300 --> 10:52.880
But...

10:54.670 --> 11:01.260
But I’ll tear Witch Beatrice and Yoshimura
Mamoru apart, if it costs my life!

11:01.260 --> 11:06.560
I’ll make Operation Cesedu Yoshimura Mamoru succeed!

11:06.560 --> 11:08.710
That’s not the right word, boss!

11:08.710 --> 11:11.440
It’s “seduce”! “Seduce”!

11:13.120 --> 11:15.090
I wonder if she’ll be alone today?

11:15.090 --> 11:16.440
It’s been a week!

11:16.440 --> 11:18.890
Did she break up with him?

11:18.890 --> 11:20.290
I never could see them together...

11:27.450 --> 11:29.170
I can’t believe it!

11:29.170 --> 11:31.150
She’s way more down than usual!

11:31.150 --> 11:32.070
Yeah.

11:32.070 --> 11:33.770
Ayako?

11:33.770 --> 11:36.780
If you eat that much when
you’re mad, it’s bad for your skin!

11:36.780 --> 11:40.700
Yes, yes... Mamoru-kun will hate you even more.

11:41.310 --> 11:42.260
Even more!

11:43.660 --> 11:46.460
Third time this episode!

11:46.460 --> 11:48.370
Brother!

11:50.600 --> 11:52.390
I-It’s tea.

11:52.390 --> 11:53.410
Have some.

11:53.410 --> 11:54.400
Thank you.

11:57.380 --> 12:03.580
<i>Ask his sign and blood type. And if you’re compatible, discreetly let him know.</i>

12:05.540 --> 12:08.870
Um, wh-what’s your sign and blood type?

12:09.930 --> 12:12.430
Type O and Aquarius. Why?

12:12.430 --> 12:14.890
I’m a Capricorn and type A!

12:14.890 --> 12:15.980
Wonderful!

12:15.980 --> 12:18.280
We’re perfectly compatible!

12:18.280 --> 12:20.870
The universe is a mysterious place.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.480
I see.

12:24.410 --> 12:28.200
<i>No matter what the type, getting close is important.</i>

12:28.200 --> 12:30.600
<i>Touch him discreetly.</i>

12:30.600 --> 12:33.080
Discreetly

12:31.180 --> 12:33.080
More German stuff?

12:33.080 --> 12:35.780
<i>Wait to shampoo until the
last minute before you leave.</i>

12:35.780 --> 12:38.980
<i>Boys will be helpless before
the scent of your hair.</i>

12:40.690 --> 12:42.730
Th-That’s kind of scary.

12:44.530 --> 12:46.210
Break’s over.

12:46.210 --> 12:47.640
Let’s practice.

12:52.310 --> 12:54.230
I see.

12:58.130 --> 13:00.820
<i>If none of that works, you should expose more skin.</i>

13:00.820 --> 13:04.130
<i>When you wear a sexy costume, his heart is yours!</i>

13:05.460 --> 13:10.360
<i>I guess I’m lacking sexiness?</i>

13:10.360 --> 13:13.020
Hey, what are you doing for Christmas?

13:13.020 --> 13:15.810
You’re spending it with
your boyfriend. Right, Tomoko?

13:15.810 --> 13:17.130
That’s so great.

13:17.130 --> 13:20.860
I want a boyfriend by Christmas.

13:21.480 --> 13:23.730
Couples spend Christmas together?

13:23.730 --> 13:28.380
In a Japanese Christmas,
couples eat dinner and cake together.

13:28.380 --> 13:30.890
Then they give each other gifts.

13:30.890 --> 13:32.600
I had no idea.

13:32.600 --> 13:34.160
It’s the Christmas industry.

13:34.440 --> 13:37.330
The Japanese are the media and
major corporations’ puppets.

13:37.330 --> 13:40.680
Jirou, that’s pretty cynical.

13:40.680 --> 13:42.320
Wait, so do you have a boyfriend?

13:42.320 --> 13:46.550
Will Yoshimura Mamoru spend it
with Witch Beatrice, then?

13:46.550 --> 13:50.520
Yeah, with how nuts those two are
or each other, I’m sure of it.

13:50.520 --> 13:51.850
Um, boss?

13:51.850 --> 13:53.990
Who will you spend it with?

13:53.990 --> 13:54.940
Boss?

13:56.690 --> 13:58.620
I have to do something...

14:00.370 --> 14:13.660
The Next Morning

14:02.210 --> 14:04.640
A welcome party for Emelenzia?

14:04.640 --> 14:10.010
Yes, she suggested we hold it after school, on the 24th.

14:10.010 --> 14:13.660
Exams will be over by Christmas Eve,
so we can really relax.

14:13.660 --> 14:16.250
Why that day, of all days?

14:16.250 --> 14:21.070
Each year in Germany, we have a big Christmas party.

14:21.070 --> 14:23.330
This year, I’m all alone in a foreign land.

14:23.330 --> 14:25.050
With no relatives or friends...

14:25.470 --> 14:28.240
You have that pair of idiots, don’t you?

14:28.860 --> 14:32.010
So we don’t mind...

14:32.620 --> 14:34.680
What about you two?

14:34.680 --> 14:36.930
You two could sleep over!

14:36.930 --> 14:38.730
A dramatic announcement!

14:39.330 --> 14:41.300
Stay over?

14:41.300 --> 14:42.560
I-I couldn’t...

14:42.560 --> 14:44.270
That’s okay.

14:44.270 --> 14:46.440
You sure? All the hotels will be full...

14:49.460 --> 14:52.650
So I guess we’ll all participate?

14:52.650 --> 14:54.450
I guess!

14:58.850 --> 15:01.450
I’m a bit disappointed, yeah.

15:01.450 --> 15:09.120
Yeah... But suddenly, spending Christmas
together alone is a little...

15:09.800 --> 15:11.970
For me, too, actually.

15:19.550 --> 15:22.750
First stage is complete.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.620
The day before exams?

15:24.620 --> 15:27.650
Yes. Classes will end in the morning.

15:27.650 --> 15:31.230
Why don’t we do some serious
training that afternoon?

15:33.040 --> 15:36.360
<i>I always spend my afternoons with Ayako-san...</i>

15:36.360 --> 15:39.370
<i>But she’s being kind enough to offer.</i>

15:40.130 --> 15:41.860
OK, got it.

15:41.860 --> 15:43.280
Thank you.

15:43.280 --> 15:44.040
Right!

15:44.690 --> 15:47.630
<i>Second stage is complete.</i>

15:48.830 --> 15:50.960
Tests tomorrow, huh?

15:50.960 --> 15:52.680
I haven’t done anything.

15:52.680 --> 15:55.210
That’s because you keep following Emelenzia around.

15:57.320 --> 15:59.310
Mamoru!

15:59.310 --> 16:01.060
Hey, there.

16:01.060 --> 16:03.370
Ayako-san, um...

16:03.370 --> 16:05.690
Want to study with me?

16:06.660 --> 16:17.840
Um... W-Well, that is... Actually...
T-Today, I promised I’d study with Watanabe.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.370
So...

16:20.370 --> 16:21.240
OK, got it!

16:21.240 --> 16:22.110
Good luck!

16:22.660 --> 16:25.470
I’ll be studying at the library.

16:25.470 --> 16:26.870
You study hard, too.

16:26.870 --> 16:28.390
I’m counting on you!

16:28.390 --> 16:29.010
Right.

16:29.010 --> 16:30.090
Bye, then.

16:31.350 --> 16:33.020
<i>I’m sorry, Ayako-san.</i>

16:33.020 --> 16:35.420
<i>But I’ll get great grades on the exam, OK?</i>

16:41.360 --> 16:42.840
<i>What’s wrong?</i>

16:42.840 --> 16:44.870
<i>N-Nothing, nothing...</i>

16:44.870 --> 16:48.130
<i>He won’t like you.</i>

16:48.130 --> 16:50.370
<i>Did she break up with Yoshimura-san?</i>

16:50.370 --> 16:52.610
<i>Um... W-Well...</i>

17:09.160 --> 17:10.700
My last training session.

17:10.700 --> 17:12.230
I have to do my best!

17:12.230 --> 17:13.490
Mamoru.

17:13.490 --> 17:15.070
Emelenzia!

17:17.030 --> 17:20.760
<i>Mamoru...</i>

17:27.710 --> 17:29.650
<i>Why a movie?</i>

17:29.650 --> 17:33.900
<i>I have to make him mine by Christmas.</i>

17:33.900 --> 17:37.070
Um, Emelenzia, what about training?

17:38.710 --> 17:40.320
I’m sorry.

17:42.970 --> 17:46.980
<i>If you’re tense, you won’t attain true concentration.</i>

17:46.980 --> 17:49.630
<i>You need to relax...</i>

17:49.630 --> 17:53.130
<i>Should I relax, then?</i>

17:53.930 --> 17:57.940
<i>#28 of the 666 ways to seduce a boy.</i>

17:57.940 --> 18:04.350
<i>Take advantage of a movie’s darkness to grab his hand.</i>

18:06.900 --> 18:08.820
Sorry... Want some?

18:08.820 --> 18:14.010
<i>#453: a roller coaster is a natural chance to hug him.</i>

18:14.010 --> 18:15.490
<i>Grab him when he doesn’t expect it.</i>

18:17.320 --> 18:19.460
We haven’t started moving.

18:20.030 --> 18:23.220
<i>#208 try the same thing at a haunted house.</i>

18:20.680 --> 18:23.830
Terrifying Thriller Mansion

18:25.060 --> 18:27.170
We still haven’t gone in, OK?

18:32.400 --> 18:33.430
<i>Why?</i>

18:33.430 --> 18:36.670
<i>Why can’t I win Mamoru?</i>

18:37.240 --> 18:38.460
<i>Your sentences!</i>

18:38.460 --> 18:43.110
<i>You need to say “nya” or “nyo” at the end!</i>

18:43.110 --> 18:44.740
<i>That’s moe!</i>

18:44.740 --> 18:45.430
<i>Moe!</i>

18:45.430 --> 18:47.600
Next-nya...

18:47.600 --> 18:49.540
Where-nya should we go nya-ext?

18:50.520 --> 18:51.400
Nya?

18:54.900 --> 18:56.810
Nyan...

18:59.440 --> 19:01.540
Broccoli-nyo?

19:02.580 --> 19:04.780
That’s cauliflower.

19:04.780 --> 19:07.130
Can we start the training?

19:13.790 --> 19:16.210
I can’t find any Em-chan anywhere.

19:16.210 --> 19:18.860
Maybe she went home.

19:18.860 --> 19:21.050
I wanted to see her before exams.

19:21.050 --> 19:22.530
<i>Watanabe-kun?</i>

19:22.530 --> 19:24.670
<i>Wasn’t he studying with Mamoru?</i>

19:25.550 --> 19:26.730
<i>No way...</i>

19:31.740 --> 19:34.100
This time I’ll succeed, OK?

19:34.100 --> 19:36.860
<i>Me, too...</i>

19:40.680 --> 19:43.220
<i>Mamoru, of all people, would never do that.</i>

19:43.220 --> 19:44.490
<i>I’m thinking too much!</i>

19:44.490 --> 19:46.510
<i>Yes, of course I am!</i>

20:03.400 --> 20:05.260
What’s going on?

20:05.260 --> 20:07.390
Don’t talk!

20:07.390 --> 20:08.140
Your eyes...

20:08.140 --> 20:09.660
Close your eyes.

20:10.280 --> 20:11.070
Right.

20:11.070 --> 20:13.360
<i>I-I guess she’s trying to tell me</i>

20:13.360 --> 20:16.230
<i>I shouldn’t get distracted over something so small.</i>

20:24.750 --> 20:27.980
Emelenzia, u-um, this is...

20:27.980 --> 20:29.900
Concentrate.

20:29.900 --> 20:30.890
Okay.

20:33.790 --> 20:34.170
Pads inserted

20:36.310 --> 20:38.120
<i>Is this German?</i>

20:39.730 --> 20:42.270
<i>Th-This feeling...</i>

20:42.270 --> 20:46.070
<i>I can’t concentrate like this...</i>

20:46.880 --> 20:48.850
Um, Emelenzia...

21:13.580 --> 21:15.680
A-Are you OK?

21:15.680 --> 21:17.170
I’m fine.

21:17.590 --> 21:20.110
L-Let’s keep going...

21:22.200 --> 21:24.320
It stopped...

21:25.890 --> 21:27.560
Here’s a tissue.

21:27.560 --> 21:28.550
Thank you.

21:29.390 --> 21:31.060
Blow your nose.

21:31.060 --> 21:31.880
Blow.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.780 --> 23:16.210
Everyone, everyone!

23:16.210 --> 23:19.970
Here’s a bit of Mitsuki trivia.

23:19.970 --> 23:22.140
I gain a lot of weight in the summer

23:22.140 --> 23:26.310
because I eat too much ice cream!

23:26.310 --> 23:32.470
So winter is my chance!

23:32.470 --> 23:36.310
If I want a photo of myself, that’s the time!

23:36.310 --> 23:43.940
Beatrice Christmas
